  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Drawn to the utility of seals in the manipulation of fate, you have taken it upon yourself to master more of them than the average cartomancer.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Seals class feature</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain one additional seal. You must meet all of the prerequisites for this seal.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You can gain this feat multiple times. Each time, select another seal that you do not know for which you meet all of the prerequisites.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/cartomancy-feats#toc8\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
